cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Quantum Sensor-aligned Telemetry Dataset (QSTD)"
abstract: >-
  1.56M quantum circuit executions on two 20-qubit computers at the Leibniz
  Supercomputing Centre. Each execution carries how well it ran, the circuit it
  ran, the facility sensor readings from the minutes before it finished, and the
  device's most recent calibration.
version: "1.0"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
